{
  "comment": [
    "The resolver's expected answers, written by hand. Every case names the grants a guest has",
    "been given and what they should then be able to see. Changing the resolver means changing",
    "this file, deliberately, line by line, which is the point of it existing.",
    "",
    "A RESTRICT IS ABSOLUTE: wherever it sits above a copy (a folder, the root,",
    "everything), no share made nearer the file, or on the file itself, undoes it.",
    "",
    "The library the cases run against is in the `world` fixture:",
    "",
    "    root                root_two",
    "      top                 other",
    "        mid",
    "          leaf",
    "",
    "    solo    one copy in `leaf`; tagged, has a person, in a collection, from a site",
    "    twin    two copies: one in `leaf`, one in `other`",
    "    loose   one copy, directly in `root`, in no folder at all",
    "    song    carried by `solo` only in the cases that grant or hide it",
    "",
    "Every grant listed is made for the guest. The admin holds none of them, and is expected to",
    "see everything regardless, which is what the `admin` column is checking."
  ],
  "cases": [
